Adds a `nvidia_temp_sensor` [GPU] option (0=gpu die [default, matches upstream], 1=memory),
mirroring the existing AMD `amd_temp_sensor` selector. Upstream smfc 6.4.2 hardcodes the nvidia
path to `--query-gpu=temperature.gpu`; some datacenter cards/driver branches (e.g. Tesla V100 on
driver 580.x) also report `temperature.memory`, which this lets smfc poll instead for the [GPU]
fan controller.
